@startuml
title Beets architectural responsibilities and selected runtime interactions
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
component "CLI and commands\nbeets.ui" as cli
component "Import workflow\nbeets.importer" as importer
component "Pipeline execution\nbeets.util.pipeline" as pipeline
component "Autotag and matching\nbeets.autotag" as autotag
component "Metadata provider orchestration\nbeets.metadata_plugins" as providers
component "Plugin loading and events\nbeets.plugins" as plugins
component "Optional extensions\nbeetsplug.*" as extensions
component "Music domain and library\nbeets.library" as library
component "Persistence, queries and types\nbeets.dbcore" as dbcore
component "Configuration, templates,\npaths and artwork utilities\nbeets / beets.util" as utils
component "mediafile" as mediafile <<external>>
database "SQLite library" as sqlite
cloud "Metadata services" as services
folder "Music files and artwork" as files
cli ..> importer : start import
cli ..> library : commands and queries
cli ..> plugins : load plugins / collect commands
importer ..> pipeline : construct and run coroutine stages
importer ..> autotag : obtain candidate matches
importer ..> library : add / update items and albums
importer ..> plugins : stages and lifecycle events
autotag ..> providers : search and retrieve metadata
providers ..> plugins : find loaded providers
providers ..> extensions : invoke provider hooks
plugins ..> extensions : dynamic import and instantiate
extensions ..> plugins : register listeners and hooks
extensions ..> library : query / modify models
extensions ..> services : HTTP and provider APIs
library ..> dbcore : specialize Database and Model
dbcore ..> sqlite : transactions / queries / schema
library ..> mediafile : read and write tags
mediafile ..> files : audio tag I/O
library ..> files : move / copy / artwork
library ..> plugins : model and file events
library ..> utils : destinations and formatting
note bottom of utils
Shared services are also used by CLI, importer, plugins and dbcore.
This is a selected responsibility view, not every source import.
The application runs in one process; external services are separate.
end note
@enduml
